    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From Gulag To Glory!</h2>Sub-human inmates Mallet and Barrow are about to unwittingly embark on an adventure that will lead them out of the gulag and into the wide-open world that they know absolutely nothing about! Help guide them through unknown territories as they battle ferocious blood-thirsty monsters, meet new friends, explore abandoned ruins, and gain assistance from the gods themselves!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic RPG Gameplay</h2>Heavily inspired by classic NES/SNES top-down RPGs.<br><br>- Classic turn-based combat<br>- Story and exploration driven progression<br>- Hybrid visual style combining hand-drawn and pixel art<br>- Dark comedy combined with heartfelt character interactions<br>- Original soundtrack specifically written to fit the story and events<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Episodic Releases!</h2>Play through all of &quot;Day One: Unwitting Liberation&quot; now! Each additional chapter will be released as free &quot;updates&quot; every 6 - 8 months (as development progresses). <strong>No DLC or Microtransactions!</strong> Once you buy the game, that's all you pay! We are a small development team dedicated to <strong>only this project</strong>! We are both deeply passionate about the genre, this story and its characters.",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">From Gulag To Glory!</h2>Sub-human inmates Mallet and Barrow are about to unwittingly embark on an adventure that will lead them out of the gulag and into the wide-open world that they know absolutely nothing about! Help guide them through unknown territories as they battle ferocious blood-thirsty monsters, meet new friends, explore abandoned ruins, and gain assistance from the gods themselves!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Classic RPG Gameplay</h2>Heavily inspired by classic NES/SNES top-down RPGs.<br><br>- Classic turn-based combat<br>- Story and exploration driven progression<br>- Hybrid visual style combining hand-drawn and pixel art<br>- Dark comedy combined with heartfelt character interactions<br>- Original soundtrack specifically written to fit the story and events<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Episodic Releases!</h2>Play through all of &quot;Day One: Unwitting Liberation&quot; now! Each additional chapter will be released as free &quot;updates&quot; every 6 - 8 months (as development progresses). <strong>No DLC or Microtransactions!</strong> Once you buy the game, that's all you pay! We are a small development team dedicated to <strong>only this project</strong>! We are both deeply passionate about the genre, this story and its characters.",
    "short_description": "- Classic turn-based combat - Story and exploration driven progression - Hybrid visual style combining hand-drawn and pixel art - Dark comedy combined with heartfelt character interactions - Original soundtrack specifically written to fit the story and events",
